Implementing a Modular Enterprise SFTP Server in C#
=====================================================

This implementation will cover the key components of an SFTP server, including SSH transport layer security, virtual file system abstraction, and audit logging.

### Prerequisites

* .NET Core 3.1 or later
* Renci.SshNet NuGet package for SSH protocol handling
* Serilog NuGet package for audit logging

### SSH Transport Layer Security

The SSH transport layer will handle the cryptographic key exchange and secure the data transfer. We will use the Renci.SshNet library to implement this.

```csharp
